//!
//! For each parent, the children are the whole `xsd:sequence` of its type in
//! the OASIS UBL 2.1 schemas, so an element no instance carries still has its place.
//! `cargo xtask codegen` fails if an instance carries a child the sequence
//! does not contain.
//!
//! The shared serialiser sorts every written element by this table.

